        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>1\" Diameter Deco Shower Door Knob Pair</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThese beautiful 1\" diameter cone shaped deco style glass shower door knobs depict a minimalism retro look.  Their solid brass construction allows for years of durable continuous use.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-SD-DECO2-size.gif?v=1704354740\" width=\"580\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deco Shower Door Knob Pair Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Single <a href=\"/products/deco-shower-door-knob-sd-deco1\"><b>Deco Shower Door Knob</b></a> and matching <a href=\"/products/deco-cabinet-knob\"><b>Deco Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in 7 different finish colors to match your bathrooms decor.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Deco Shower Door Knobs\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Glass Hole Diameter: 3/8\" - 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with 2 deco knobs and includes all the hardware for back to back mounting (knobs hook to each other) on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors, with either a 3/8\" or 1/2\" diameter hole in the glass.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Pair (2 Knobs - 1 knob for each side of the glass)</b>\r\n</p>",
